ereunder be “at-will” employment. The Company or you may terminate your employment at any time and for any reason, with or without Cause, and with or without notice, in all cases subject to Section 8 of this Agreement. The “at-will” nature of your employment shall remain unchanged during your tenure as an employee of the Company, and may only be changed by an express written agreement that is signed by you and the Board.","section":"","block":22,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-027964","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-16","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001953926","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1953926/000110465926027964/zbio-20251231xex10d25.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/4f50e780da8c95c1799114b5174f27edf74ed50a5bafc1457cabded95a7d018f.bin","sha256":"4f50e780da8c95c1799114b5174f27edf74ed50a5bafc1457cabded95a7d018f"}},{"id":"3c7a10c5ad274478e67c36d6ad609af861f039aecca3ef251901d3abfdbb5ae7","quote":"“Good Reason” shall mean the following, if occurring without your consent: (i) the assignment to you of any duties or responsibilities which result in the material diminution of your duties and/or responsibilities (other than temporarily while physically or mentally incapacitated or as required by applicable law); (ii) a reduction by the Company in your annual base salary or target bonus opportunity (other than in the context of an across-the-board reduction for similarly situated executives); (iii) relocation of the Company’s Boston metropolitan area office to another location by more than thirty (30) miles that adversely affects your commute to such office; or (iv) material breach by the Company of the terms of this Agreement. In order to terminate your employment for Good Reason, you must provide the Company with a written notice detailing the specific circumstances alleged to constitute Good Reason within ninety (90) days after the first occurrence of such circumstances, and the Company shall have thirty (30) days following receipt of such notice to cure such circumstances in all material respects, and, to the extent not cured, you shall have resigned for Good Reason not later than the 180th day following the first occurrence of any Good Reason event (or to the extent it recurs, after the first occurrence of such recurrence).","context":"a “separation from service” you shall on such date automatically be terminated from employment as a Disability termination.","section":"","block":36,"table":null,"attribution":"issuer_disclosure","interpretation":"source_excerpt_not_independently_verified","source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-027964","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-16","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001953926","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1953926/000110465926027964/zbio-20251231xex10d25.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/4f50e780da8c95c1799114b5174f27edf74ed50a5bafc1457cabded95a7d018f.bin","sha256":"4f50e780da8c95c1799114b5174f27edf74ed50a5bafc1457cabded95a7d018f"}}],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"riskFactors":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"segmentIntelligence":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0}},"warnings":[]},{"version":1,"source":{"accession":"0001104659-26-027964","form":"10-K","filedAt":"2026-03-16","reportDate":"2025-12-31","cik":"0001953926","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1953926/000110465926027964/zbio-20251231xex10d31.htm","rawPath":"sec/raw/83d22aa2172f093573dd104c4123d2ae73f69499f9c861374a50b13c1d4641d5.bin","sha256":"83d22aa2172f093573dd104c4123d2ae73f69499f9c861374a50b13c1d4641d5"},"layers":{"businessProfile":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"operatingKpis":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"managementExplanations":{"status":"no_evidence","evidence":[],"omittedEvidenceCount":0},"materialEvents":{"status":"evidence_available","evidence":[{"id":"9e92f78